Modifications (homebridge-hap-homematic, 2026, california444)

This fork is maintained independently; no changes are exchanged with
the upstream project. Modified files carry a "Modified by california444
(2026)" notice at the top (Apache-2.0, section 4(b)).

  * 2026-11-11  Forked at d635ecf. Renamed package to
                homebridge-hap-homematic and the platform to HapHomematic;
                Node >= 24 and Homebridge >= 2.4.0 only; CI on Node 24.
  * 2026-11-11  Window-covering movement reporting
                (src/services/impl/BlindAccessory.ts and
                test/unit/blindMovement.test.ts) taken from upstream
                commit 2011787 (2026-11-11), Apache-2.0.
  * 2026-11-11  XML-RPC only: removed the JSON-RPC control plane,
                system variables, programs, rooms, the hap-homematic
                import, multi-bridge support and the BidCos-Wired /
                VirtualDevices / CUxD interfaces; discovery via XML-RPC
                listDevices. The tar and iconv-lite dependencies listed
                in the upstream notice above are no longer used.
